{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI \u00d7 Pixel Art Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>AI Pixel Battle</strong>, your goal is to draw a monster that seems capable of defeating the one shown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI doesn\u2019t just decide the winner \u2014 it also names your monster, describes its traits, and tells the story of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras/c5357d21a2329a0756c841b4b46ff8c0.avif?t=1773991598\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Original Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters you draw can be saved in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your very own collection of original monsters!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras/53089c27ba0a7072ff2b25a5c312e532.avif?t=1773991598\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras_big/53089c27ba0a7072ff2b25a5c312e532.webp?t=1773991598 width=1560 height=637 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pixel Art Battle with Family and Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can battle with your friends and family locally or via Steam Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a monster that looks stronger than your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras/ec9dae4ae73abc810f2a75bc6a50b988.avif?t=1773991598\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras_big/ec9dae4ae73abc810f2a75bc6a50b988.webp?t=1773991598 width=1560 height=693 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994120?t=1773991598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994120?t=1773991598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/d8267ffcb9ea7037b421569c02db327338fba6a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773991598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/d8267ffcb9ea7037b421569c02db327338fba6a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773991598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI \u00d7 Pixel Art Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>AI Pixel Battle</strong>, your goal is to draw a monster that seems capable of defeating the one shown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI doesn\u2019t just decide the winner \u2014 it also names your monster, describes its traits, and tells the story of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras/c5357d21a2329a0756c841b4b46ff8c0.avif?t=1773991598\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Original Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters you draw can be saved in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your very own collection of original monsters!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras/53089c27ba0a7072ff2b25a5c312e532.avif?t=1773991598\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras_big/53089c27ba0a7072ff2b25a5c312e532.webp?t=1773991598 width=1560 height=637 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pixel Art Battle with Family and Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can battle with your friends and family locally or via Steam Remote Play Together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a monster that looks stronger than your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras/ec9dae4ae73abc810f2a75bc6a50b988.avif?t=1773991598\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/extras_big/ec9dae4ae73abc810f2a75bc6a50b988.webp?t=1773991598 width=1560 height=693 /></span></p>","developers":["MONO ENTERTAINMENT"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994120/fa25ea08fa3a666f2e16997767e7d308122e8bd4/header.jpg?t=1773991598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994120/472487720/707e75cba1a260d9b2c425adf2fdf086f7c5bb34/1762955992/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762956279","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994120/472487720/707e75cba1a260d9b2c425adf2fdf086f7c5bb34/1762955992/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762956279","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994120/472487720/707e75cba1a260d9b2c425adf2fdf086f7c5bb34/1762955992/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762956279","id":257198872,"name":"PV1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198872/d923a2db3f